//! Larger randomized tests for RNS basis extension and modulus dropping
//! (Workstream 3 item 2). Complements `tests/phase2.rs`'s single hardcoded
//! large-basis case and `tests/property_tests.rs`'s small-basis generative
//! coverage with many independently-computed cases at realistic RNS-CKKS/BGV
//! scale (multiple source/target moduli, source-basis products spanning
//! 161-561 bits - always far beyond `u128`).

